      "content": "it just feels so poetic, in a way. like the house itself wants to be reclaimed by the earth. i dont want a 'bright day' or a 'solution'. i just want the weight to stop. everything is so loud and cluttered... wouldn't it be more beautiful if it just drifted away into the silence of the fog? like a song that just fades out instead of breaking?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
